  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diougoudiam Women&apos;s Union Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beneficiaries: 236 women, Sector: Food production (rice and assorted vegetables), Town/City: Selibaby Commune, Guidimakha Region , Summary: The project funds will be used to install a new irrigation system and fence it to protect it from roaming animals. The Cooperative will set deepen two current wells and dig a new well to provide a reliable and constant source of water to the production perimeter. These activities will enable Cooperative members to dramatically increase the volume of vegetables sold and the profit earned by group members. Members will also benefit from improved equipment for their womens center for sewing and embroidery activities.,</narrative>
  </description>
